Brainfuck program that prints "Hello World!" converted
to Oats instruction-by-instruction using the conversion
table. In Oats there is no easy way to convert ASCII
codes to characters, so this program just outputs the
ASCII codes of the string "Hello World!". The conversion
from ASCII codes to characters is left as an exersice to
the reader :D